/*
 * Implements validation for `throw` expressions in Ymir.
 *
 * A `throw` expression aborts the current control flow by raising an exception
 * value. It may only appear inside a function or lambda body.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::instruction::throw_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/instruction/throw_.yr
